---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  title="About | Berlin Studio Map"
  description="A free, independent directory of photography studios for hire in Berlin."
  canonical="https://berlinstudiomaps.com/about/"
>
<div class="container">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div>
  <h1>About Berlin Studio Map</h1>
  <p>Berlin Studio Map is a free directory of photography studios for hire across the city, built for photographers and producers who are tired of trawling separate listing sites to compare studios.</p>
  <p>It consolidates studio information in one searchable, filterable place, so you can compare daylight, infinity coves, blackout, drive-in access, and facilities like kitchens and makeup rooms side by side, on a map.</p>

  <h2>Data &amp; Accuracy</h2>
  <p>Every studio on this site has been reviewed and confirmed rather than left as a rough estimate. If you run one of these studios and something is wrong, or missing, please get in touch and we'll fix it.</p>

  <h2>Who Built This</h2>
  <div class="builder">
    <p>Berlin Studio Map was built by me, <a href="https://www.betoruizalonso.com/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Beto Ruiz Alonso</a>, a Berlin-based photographer working across portrait, fashion, and event photography. I built this site as a personal solution to the same problem every visiting or local photographer runs into: comparing studios across daylight, coves, and facilities meant checking a dozen different listing sites. Follow me on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/betoruizalonso/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>.</p>
    <img src="/betoruizalonso.jpg" alt="Beto Ruiz Alonso" width="120" height="120" class="builder-photo" />
  </div>

  <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
  <p>Studio suggestions, corrections, and feedback: <a href="mailto:hello@berlinstudiomaps.com">hello@berlinstudiomaps.com</a></p>
</div>

<style>
  .builder {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .builder-photo {
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .builder {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
</PageLayout>
